          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Connect — {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} | {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Contact {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} for bespoke aromatherapy sessions, blends, and a VIP Day experience. Safety-forward guidance.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg:#fbfbfd; --card:#ffffff; --muted:#6b6f76; --accent:#6a8f6f; --accent-2:#7c5aa3; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\\n      --max-width:1100px; --radius:14px;\\n      font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial;\\n    }\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#f6f8fb 60%);color:#122;}\\n    /* pattern from assets/img/pattern.svg */\\n    header{background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(122,163,136,0.06),rgba(124,90,163,0.04)), url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-repeat:repeat;padding:28px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(18,34,40,0.04);}\\n    .nav{max-width:var(--max-width);margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\\n    .logo{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600}\\n    nav a.active{background:rgba(106,143,111,0.09);color:var(--accent)}\\n    main{max-width:var(--max-width);margin:28px auto;padding:24px}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px;align-items:start}\\n    .hero-card{background:var(--card);padding:26px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(18,34,40,0.06)}\\n    .hero h1{margin:0;font-size:28px;color:#072;letter-spacing:-0.6px}\\n    .hero p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:12px 0 18px}\\n    .contact-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .pill{display:inline-flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;background:var(--glass);border-radius:999px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}\\n    .form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(10,18,24,0.06);font-size:14px}\\n    .row{display:flex;gap:12px}\\n    .row .col{flex:1}\\n    button.cta{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#fff;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;border:0;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}\\n    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    /* Social proof */\\n    .testimonials{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:18px}\\n    blockquote{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.7),var(--card));padding:14px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(10,18,24,0.03);margin:0}\\n    blockquote p{margin:0;color:#243}\\n    /* benefits/process/faq */\\n    .grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:22px}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(10,18,24,0.03)}\\n    dl{margin:0}\\n    dt{font-weight:700;margin-top:10px}\\n    dd{margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted)}\\n    footer{max-width:var(--max-width);margin:36px auto 80px;padding:18px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    @media (max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.testimonials{grid-template-columns:1fr}.grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"nav\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\">A</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Offerings</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"blends.html\\\">Blends</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"shop.html\\\">Boutique</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Invest</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\" class=\\\"active\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <!-- HERO -->\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"hero-card\\\">\\n        <h1>Connect with {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} — bespoke aromatherapy in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Schedule a conversation, ask about a VIP Day, or request a custom take-home blend. All guidance is safety-forward and tailored to your lifestyle.</p>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"contact-list\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Phone: <strong style=\\\"margin-left:8px\\\">{{PHONE}}</strong></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Email: <strong style=\\\"margin-left:8px\\\">{{EMAIL}}</strong></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">Office hours: Mon–Fri, 9:00–17:00 {{STATE}} time. Response within 48 hours.</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\" class=\\\"small\\\">Prefer a direct booking? <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Make a session request</a> or use the form to tell us about your needs.</div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"testimonials\\\">\\n          <blockquote>\\n            <p>\\\"The bespoke blend I received is subtle and reliably calming without overwhelming my senses. Thoughtful, safe, and professional.\\\"</p>\\n            <div class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">— L.M., {{CITY}}</div>\\n          </blockquote>\\n          <blockquote>\\n            <p>\\\"I booked a VIP Day and left with a clear ritual and a blend I use daily. The process was thorough and respectful of my sensitivities.\\\"</p>\\n            <div class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">— J.T., remote consultation</div>\\n          </blockquote>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"hero-card\\\">\\n        <form class=\\\"form\\\" action=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" method=\\\"POST\\\" enctype=\\\"text/plain\\\">\\n          <label class=\\\"small\\\">Full name</label>\\n          <input name=\\\"name\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\" required />\\n          <label class=\\\"small\\\">Email</label>\\n          <input name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@email.com\\\" required />\\n          <label class=\\\"small\\\">Phone (optional)</label>\\n          <input name=\\\"phone\\\" placeholder=\\\"(555) 555-5555\\\" />\\n          <label class=\\\"small\\\">Preferred service</label>\\n          <select name=\\\"service\\\">\\n            <option>Discovery call</option>\\n            <option>Custom blend</option>\\n            <option>VIP Day</option>\\n            <option>Retail purchase / shop</option>\\n          </select>\\n          <label class=\\\"small\\\">Tell me about your goals & sensitivities</label>\\n          <textarea name=\\\"message\\\" rows=\\\"4\\\" placeholder=\\\"Any allergies, pregnancy, pets at home, or scent sensitivities?\\\" ></textarea>\\n\\n          <label style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\"><input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" name=\\\"consent\\\" required style=\\\"margin-right:8px\\\"/>I acknowledge aromatherapy is supportive self-care and not a substitute for medical advice.</label>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px\\\">\\n            <button class=\\\"cta\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>\\n            <a href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-grid;place-items:center;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(124,90,163,0.08);color:var(--accent-2);text-decoration:none;font-weight:700\\\">Quick book</a>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">We protect your information. By contacting us you consent to store the details you provide for the purpose of scheduling and delivering aromatherapy services.</div>\\n        </form>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- BENEFITS + PROCESS -->\\n    <section class=\\\"grid2\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Benefits of a tailored aromatherapy plan</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Options designed for daily life — aroma-first, safety-forward.</p>\\n        <dl>\\n          <dt>Thoughtful scent layering</dt>\\n          <dd>Top, middle, and base notes blended for a balanced aroma profile and lasting presence.</dd>\\n          <dt>Practical rituals</dt>\\n          <dd>Simple at-home protocols to integrate blends into brewing, bedtime, or workspace practices.</dd>\\n          <dt>Clear safety guidance</dt>\\n          <dd>Personalized dilution, patch-test instructions, and pet/pregnancy considerations.</dd>\\n        </dl>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">How a VIP Day unfolds</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">A focused day to co-create your signature blends and knowledge to use them safely.</p>\\n        <ol style=\\\"padding-left:18px;margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n          <li><strong>Pre-call:</strong> intake & scent prompt, allergies, and goals.</li>\\n          <li><strong>Profile session:</strong> live scent exploration (in-person or virtual).</li>\\n          <li><strong>Formulation:</strong> bespoke blend(s) crafted with clear dilution math and storage notes.</li>\\n          <li><strong>Takeaways:</strong> labeled samples, written care card, and a short ritual plan.</li>\\n        </ol>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- FAQ -->\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Frequently asked — safety & common questions</h3>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;display:grid;gap:12px\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <strong>How should I dilute essential oils?</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">Dilution depends on use and user. Typical topical dilutions range from 0.5–5% for adults. Your personalized guidance will include exact drop counts and carrier recommendations. Avoid undiluted application.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <strong>What is a patch test?</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">A patch test uses a small diluted sample on the forearm for 24–48 hours to check sensitivity before broader use. We include patch-test instructions with every new topical blend.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <strong>Are essential oils safe around pets?</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">Some oils can be harmful to animals in concentrated form. We provide pet-safe alternatives, diffuser placement guidance, and avoidance lists when animals are in the home.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <strong>Can I use aromatherapy during pregnancy?</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">Pregnancy needs special precautions. We avoid certain constituents and always recommend discussing options with your healthcare provider. Safe alternatives are available for most needs.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- LEAD MAGNET -->\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Free guide: Safe at-home aromatherapy</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Subscribe to receive a concise PDF with dilution charts, patch-test steps, and a 5-minute bedside ritual.</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <input id=\\\"leadEmail\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your email\\\" />\\n        <button class=\\\"cta\\\" id=\\\"downloadGuide\\\">Send me the guide</button>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">No spam. Unsubscribe at any time.</div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- CALL TO ACTION -->\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px;display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"flex:1\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Ready to begin a mindful scent journey?</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Book a discovery call or request a VIP Day. We tailor blends with clear safety instructions and practical rituals.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\\\">\\n        <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n        <a style=\\\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;background:transparent;border:1px dashed rgba(10,18,24,0.06);text-align:center;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Request VIP Day</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer>\\n    <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} | Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href=\\\"privacy.html\\\">Privacy</a> • <a href=\\\"terms.html\\\">Terms</a></div>\\n  </footer>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    // Lead magnet: create a simple text-PDF-like file (plain text) and trigger download after email entry.\\n    document.getElementById('downloadGuide').addEventListener('click', function(e){\\n      var email = document.getElementById('leadEmail').value.trim();\\n      if(!email){alert('Please enter your email to receive the guide.');return}\\n      var content = 'Safe at-home aromatherapy guide\\\\n\\\\nDilution chart (approx):\\\\n- 0.5% (sensitive adults): 3 drops per 30ml\\\\n- 1% (general adult use): 6 drops per 30ml\\\\n- 2% (short-term topical use): 12 drops per 30ml\\\\n\\\\nPatch-test: apply a 1% dilution to inner forearm. Wait 24–48 hours. Discontinue if irritation.\\\\n\\\\nPets & pregnancy: consult your vet or healthcare provider. Avoid concentrated topical use near animals.\\\\n\\\\nFor personalized plans, reply to this message or book a discovery call.\\\\n\\\\n-- {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{BUSINESS_NAME}}';\\n      var blob = new Blob([content],{type:'text/plain;charset=utf-8'});\\n      var url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);\\n      var a = document.createElement('a'); a.href = url; a.download = 'aromatherapy-safe-guide.txt'; document.body.appendChild(a); a.click(); a.remove();\\n      setTimeout(function(){URL.revokeObjectURL(url);},1000);\\n      // Optionally: send to placeholder email via mailto for follow-up (user can manually send)\\n      window.open('mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject=Guide%20Request&body=Please%20send%20me%20the%20guide%20and%20info%20about%20a%20VIP%20Day.%20Email:%20'+encodeURIComponent(email));\\n    });\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"This chunk contains the contact page and usage notes for the aromatherapy site bundle.\\n\\nFiles included:\\n- contact.html — The full contact/connect page with hero, social proof, benefits, process, FAQ, lead magnet, and CTA sections. Uses placeholders to be replaced by your templating system:\\n  - {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n  - {{TAGLINE}}\\n  - {{PHONE}}\\n  - {{EMAIL}}\\n  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n  - {{CITY}}\\n  - {{STATE}}\\n  - {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}\\n  - {{FAVORITE_BLEND}} (not required on this page but available globally)\\n\\nNotes and integration tips:\\n- The page references an SVG background at assets/img/pattern.svg. Ensure that file is present in the assets/img folder (created in another chunk) for the repeating pattern to render.\\n- The contact form uses a mailto action as a simple submit fallback. Replace with your preferred backend endpoint or AJAX handler to capture requests.\\n- Lead magnet: clicking the guide button creates and downloads a plain text guide and opens a mailto prefilled to {{EMAIL}} so the lead receives follow-up instructions. Replace or extend this with a server-side mailing list flow if desired.\\n- Accessibility: form fields include labels and reasonable focus/contrast. Further accessibility audits are recommended.\\n\\nDesign/voice:\\n- The layout follows the \\\"lux_gallery\\\" family: generous cards, soft gradients, and an elegant palette.\\n- Voice follows the \\\"practical_guide\\\" style: clear, safety-forward, and action-oriented.\\n- The offer model is \\\"VIP Day\\\" and the process section outlines the steps of that VIP Day.\\n\\nSafety & content rules:\\n- No medical claims are made. The FAQ includes dilution, patch test, pets, and pregnancy guidance as required.\\n- All aromatherapy notes are supportive and framed as self-care.\\n\\nCustomization suggestions:\\n- Replace placeholder values with real business data before publishing.\\n- Swap the mailto form action for a secure server endpoint and integrate an anti-spam measure (reCAPTCHA or honeypot) if needed.\\n- Consider converting the plain-text lead magnet to a PDF generated server-side for improved branding.\\n\\nChunk 4 delivered files only; other pages (index.html, blends.html, shop.html, etc.) are in other chunks of the full bundle.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
